flowchart TB
 ANN[(Tags + present annotation edges)] --> SNAP[Bounded validated snapshot]
 SNAP --> ENC[AES-GCM / runtime backup key]
 ENC --> BUCKET[Unique private bucket per snapshot]
 BUCKET --> KEEP[Keep three successful daily copies]
 BUCKET --> OP[Explicit operator restore]
 OP --> CHECK[Owner + epoch + revision + key link + schema]
 CHECK --> TX[SQL replaces annotations / invalidates undo]
 DISC[Owner confirms disconnect] --> FENCE[Increment epoch / revoke sessions / cancel leases]
 FENCE --> PURGE[Purge product rows + retire backup targets]
 PURGE --> DELETE[Storage object and bucket deletion]
 DELETE --> ABS[Verify application-controlled absence]
 ABS --> DONE[Disconnect complete]
 FENCE -. existing Spotify playlists remain .-> SP[Spotify]